    feat(obsdb-003): count embedding request outcomes and cache residency
    
    Adds duckbrain_embedding_requests_total{provider,outcome} plus
    duckbrain_embedding_cache_hits_total / _misses_total, incremented at the real
    provider call (instrumentEmbedder on both product construction points) and at
    the single cache-residency decision (EmbeddingCache.get), and registers the
    process-wide counters on the per-app scrape registry. Labels collapse the
    eleven internal failure classes onto ok|timeout|auth|quota|error and keep only
    the registry provider id — never the model, host or error text.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
